      "raw_html": "<div class=\"question\" id=\"question-72143\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">3.</span><a class=\"questionKP\" href=\"/topics/1979#6102\">Identifying Type II Regions</a><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"72143\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionGraphicFrame\"><img class=\"questionGraphic\" src=\"/graphics/q-72143\"/></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>Which of the following represents the shaded region above as a type II region in two-dimensional space? </p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyModerate\">M</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Sat, Oct 10th @ 10:38 PM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:10</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: red;\">Incorrect</span></span></div></div>"
